# NOTE: The Pitch server address is NOT set here.
# You enter it in the Streamlit sidebar ("Server IP" field) at runtime.
#   - Same PC as the pitch:   localhost   (the default)
#   - Different PC:            the pitch PC's LAN IP, e.g. 192.168.1.50
